Mayor’s Message
Dear Citizens,
I am excited to present our Smart Adama Guidebook, which demonstrates our commitment
to building a smarter, sustainable, and inclusive urban environment. As we confront rapid
population growth, environmental issues, public safety concerns, and rising service demands,
it is clear that innovative solutions are needed. This guidebook details our strategic plan
for implementing advanced technologies, promoting innovation, and leveraging data-driven
initiatives to address these challenges. Through our smart Adama initiatives, we strive to
improve residents’ quality of life by developing resilient public services, ensuring safety, and
creating a competitive city that benefits both residents and local businesses.
Our vision is centered around the aspiration to elevate the standard of living for every individual in our community. By uniting our efforts, we can collaboratively create an innovative
hub that supports entrepreneurs, improves the overall business climate, and fosters a vibrant, inclusive, and livable city that is prepared to meet the demands and opportunities of
the future.
Furthermore, I would like to take this opportunity to extend my heartfelt gratitude to all our
stakeholders. Your invaluable contributions and collaborative spirit have played a pivotal
role in the ongoing transformation of Adama. It is through your dedication and hard work
that we are witnessing significant advancements, and we wholeheartedly acknowledge the
positive impact your efforts will undoubtedly have on shaping the future of our beloved city.
Together, we are paving the way for a brighter tomorrow.
Sincerely,
Mr. Hailu Jelde
Mayor of Adama City
